<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZAIRE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZAIRE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Zaire 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a World Cup African group three qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Phil Masinga (72)</p>
<p>Attendance: 65,000</p>
</text>
